			"text": "the same road, walked badly. Every press in this script is mistimed on purpose: press_until_state mashes, and only the FIRST press of a cue is captured - so a masher's press always lands early and never scores. That is the point. A driver that plays well only ever visits the branches good play reaches, and the branches this game most needs proven - a fight lost, a boss that will not let you run, the road back afterwards - are exactly the ones it never sees."
		},
